// What the model gives, written by `BLESS=1` (design/19-cases.md).
run 1: Readings { visibility: ByMember, deferral: Recording }, every order
outcome 1
  accepted
  value 0: i32
  value A: {x: i32}
  value `a.x`: i32
  value `pick(a)`: {x: i32}
  decision `a.x`: applied
  decision pick: pick#0
  partition {0, `a.x`}
  check `0 <= a.x`: Ok(Identity)
  check `A ~> pick.Param(0)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `pick(a) <= A`: Ok(Identity)
  check `pick.Result <= pick(a)`: Ok(Identity)
  I* of a final state: []
